nge":{"column":0,"endColumn":87,"endLine":448,"line":443},"type":57,"typeText":"(𝕜 : Type u_1) →\n  (𝕜' : Type u_2) →\n    (E : Type u_3) →\n      [inst : NormedField.{u_1} 𝕜] →\n        [inst_1 : NormedField.{u_2} 𝕜'] →\n          [NormedAlgebra.{u_1, u_2} 𝕜 𝕜'] →\n            [inst_3 : SeminormedAddCommGroup.{u_3} E] →\n              [NormedSpace.{u_2, u_3} 𝕜' E] → NormedSpace.{u_1, u_3} 𝕜 (RestrictScalars.{u_1, u_2, u_3} 𝕜 𝕜' E)","unsafe":false,"value":157,"source":{"code":"/-- If `E` is a normed space over `𝕜'` and `𝕜` is a normed algebra over `𝕜'`, then\n`RestrictScalars.module` is additionally a `NormedSpace`. -/\ninstance RestrictScalars.normedSpace : NormedSpace 𝕜 (RestrictScalars 𝕜 𝕜' E) :=\n  { RestrictScalars.module 𝕜 𝕜' E with\n    norm_smul_le := fun c x =>\n      (norm_smul_le (algebraMap 𝕜 𝕜' c) (_ : E)).trans_eq <| by rw [norm_algebraMap'] }","start":443,"end":448},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}